    <h3>
      The right fit is essential for your comfort and ease of movement. Our easy-to-use calculator will help you find
      your ideal boxer size in just a few simple steps
    </h3>
    <h5>How It Works:</h5>
    <ul>
      <li><p><span>Measure Your Waist:</span>
      
        Using a soft measuring tape, measure around your natural waistline, just above your hips. Make sure the tape is
        snug but not tight.
      </p></li>
     
        <li><p><span>Measure Your Inseam:</span>

        Measure from the top of your inner thigh down to the bottom of your ankle.</p></li>
      
      <li>
       <p> <span>Calculate Your Size:</span>

        Click the "Calculate" button to find your perfect boxer size. The calculator will determine the ideal size based
        on your measurements, ensuring a comfortable fit. Once you have your perfect boxer size, browse our wide range of stylish and comfortable boxers designed to fit every
    body type.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>

   

    <div class="boxer-size-calculator bra-size">
      <!-- <h2>Find Your Boxer Size!</h2> -->

      <form id="boxer-size-form">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12 underbust-bef" style="position:relative;">
            <label for="waist">Waist measurement (in inches):</label>
            <input type="number" id="waist" name="waist" min="20" max="50" step="0.5" required>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12 underbust-bef" style="position:relative;">
            <label for="inseam">Inseam measurement (in inches):</label>
            <input type="number" id="inseam" name="inseam" min="20" max="40" step="0.5" required>
